; claude: a web browser's engine, from scratch, for teaching: one idea
; per module, each .mli with its diagram, worked example and
; references, like networking/ and ai/ (see web/README.md,
; plan_browser_teaching.md, notes_browser.md). Pure OCaml, no shapes:
; bytes in, a tree, boxes with positions out; TinyMosaic
; (apps/internet/) draws them.
;
; A library per subdirectory; this one, 'web', has no module of its
; own: it is all of them, for what says (libraries web). Unwrapped, or
; dune would make it a module Web.
(library
 (name web)
 (package elm_playground)
 (wrapped false)
 (modules)
 (libraries web_html web_style web_layout)
)
